# ClinicalTrials.gov refresh pipeline (run_pipeline.py --refresh):
# raw API JSON (~40MB/fetch) and dated snapshot CSVs (~15MB/fetch)
# both regenerate on demand and would balloon repo size fast under a
# daily refresh cadence. trials.csv (the "current" working dataset)
# stays tracked as before — only the raw/dated archive is ignored.
data/raw/
data/snapshots/
trials.csv.pre_refresh_backup
